  {
   "fieldname": "packing_operating_cost",
   "fieldtype": "Currency",
   "label": "Packing Operating Cost",
   "default": "0",
   "description": "Labor/overhead cost for running this packing line (e.g. Workstation hour rate x time for the packing operation). Not read from the BOM -- Packing BOMs deliberately don't carry an Operations table (that belongs to the Manufacturing BOM that produced the bulk item), so this is entered directly per run. Absorbed into the packed item's valuation the same way a Work Order's Total Operating Cost is absorbed into its finished good -- see post_packing_consumption()."
  },
